The keyed singleton registration used in the extension method is not a standard IServiceCollection feature. It likely comes from a custom extension method AddKeyedSingleton. The keyed service resolution is not standard either. I will instead test that the service collection contains a registration for IImageToTextService with the expected service type factory. I will also test that the returned IServiceCollection is the same instance. This will verify the AddHuggingFaceImageToText extension method calls GetService on IServiceProvider internally and registers the service correctly.

I will submit a test that verifies the service registration exists and the returned IServiceCollection is the same instance. This avoids the need to resolve the keyed service which is not standard.

